{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1522205001:0":{"text":"手を出すな！軍隊をなめるなよ。","source_cn":"谁敢动手？！真当军队都是摆设吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A86B303D1691747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522205002:0":{"text":"ホーリン城の支援物資は、<style=\"highlight\">全ての住民のもの</style>だ。金があるなしは関係ない！","source_cn":"呼临城的赈灾粮，自然<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCB9ED3E6EE41F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522205003:0":{"text":"今度騒ぎを起こしたら、牢にぶち込むぞ！","source_cn":"要是谁再闹事，就等着被我关进牢里去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA041A46751A393F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522205004:1":{"text":"あれは命をつなぐ食料なんだぞ！そんなのおかしいだろ！","source_cn":"——那些是救命的粮食！你怎么能这么做？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3943597FC2139A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522205005:0":{"text":"うるさい、もう副官様の判断が下りただろうが！","source_cn":"去去去！没听到副将大人都发话了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868640084EFAEAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1522205006:0":{"text":"まだ文句があるなら、あとは牢屋で言え！","source_cn":"你要是再闹事，就等着被投牢吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C99188397E6ADA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522205007:0":{"text":"はは……こんなおかしな展開になるとはな。","source_cn":"哈哈……没想到还有这么好笑的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB260A5978D7C272F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522205008:0":{"text":"なあ、お前らの相談ごと、ペルセウスには伝えたのか？お前らが<style=\"highlight\">結託して支援物資を横取りしてる</style>……って話。","source_cn":"我很好奇，你们商量好的事告诉珀尔修斯了吗？他知道你们<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CBB2B59D8108C47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522205009:0":{"text":"なっ……おい、言いがかりはやめろ！","source_cn":"你……你这话几个意思？！我、我警告你，不要血口喷人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7880DD33040840AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522205010:1":{"text":"ええ、その通り。ペルセウスさまは、あなたたちを裁くでしょう。","source_cn":"他没有说错。珀尔修斯会惩罚你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBD57C926995BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522205011:0":{"text":"黙れ、この獣が！","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1522205011":{"text":"黙れ、この獣が！","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522205014:0":{"text":"ロンゴスさん、干ばつは雨で癒せても、ホーリン城の飢饉は一朝一夕では解決しませんよ。","source_cn":"隆尔副将，干旱尚可盼望一场大雨缓解，但呼临城的饥荒绝非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2EA08E6678BF8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522205015:0":{"text":"愚見ながら、<style=\"highlight\">食料が限られている今は、より深刻な被災者を優先すべきかと</style>。","source_cn":"在存粮有限的境况下，以我拙见，<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE874FD99CCE4024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522205016:0":{"text":"いかがでしょう？","source_cn":"你认为呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2889209D717D19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522205017:0":{"text":"……ホーリンのことだ、よそ者が口を挟むな。","source_cn":"……这是呼临城的事，不用你费心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11D4A5FCCC20DC32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522205018:0":{"text":"カリアン、食料は本当に困ってる連中にだけ配れ。イアソンみたいな奴には渡すな。","source_cn":"卡利安，把粮食分给那些饥民，不许伊阿宋这样的家伙领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C21704B6CB5479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1522205019:0":{"text":"えっ！？しかし、副官様……","source_cn":"啊？！可是副将大人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B4C534FC3CAC9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1522205020:1":{"text":"うるさい！さっさと行け！","source_cn":"闭嘴！滚到一边去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA7315743B86776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1522205021:0":{"text":"貴様もだ！ぼーっと突っ立ってないで、さっさと配れ！","source_cn":"还有你！杵在这里发什么愣？还不快去发粮食！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C41ABBD5C106B5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1522205022:0":{"text":"は、はいっ！","source_cn":"是……是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5551519BB81AA98D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""